From: sdolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: map j314s DP-IN source explicitly

Opt-in experimental source bridge; apply after 0001 through 0006.
Prepare DCP outside the TB lock before any DPRX read. Match source
ownership and asynchronous cancellation to the tunnel lifetime.
Adopt discovered host tunnels and keep domain references until destroy.
See DCP-SOURCE-BRIDGE.md for validation and qualification limits.

Signed-off-by: sdolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t600x-j314-j316.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t600x-j314-j316.dtsi
index 15932b6..f365bd8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t600x-j314-j316.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t600x-j314-j316.dtsi
@@ -867,6 +867,11 @@ &pmp_report_isp_sys {
 #include "hwmon-laptop.dtsi"
 
 #ifdef ENABLE_DCPEXT_TB_TUNNEL
+&usb4_1_nhi {
+	apple,dp-source = <&dcpext1>;
+	apple,dp-in-port = <5>;
+};
+
 &dpin1_0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
